WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
You choose a photograph. A moment later, someone hands it back.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.500
But researchers sometimes exchanged it for the picture you rejected.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.500
Some people did not notice. They still explained why they chose it.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.500
The experiment is called choice blindness. It is not proof of mind control.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:34.500
A persuasive explanation is different from an independent record.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Keep the evidence. Then examine the story. Final Vestige.
